  "details": "Vrchat is loading Extremly slow and I can't join a world that i've already been in before or it will just download a map at 0.00 / 0.00 and would never load the map at all for 5 - 20 mins of waiting. Plus if i even get into a world i've been in before with other players around their avatars usually take about 5-10 mins to even load my internet speeds are 2MB/s Down and 0.4mb/s Up but with the bad internet I've been fine but recently it's been going down the drain because of this problem. The avatars as well as the social menu and worlds menu the are both taking 5-10 mins to even load the thumbnails for the worlds same with the friends lists. I've tried everything on my end about the like reseting routier, Re-installing VRChat, Clearing Cache and none of that seemed to help",
